  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conserving Wetland Biodiversity: Capacity Building and Mapping Mexican Wetlands for Compliance with the Ramsar Convention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to Mexico to meet their obligations under the Ramsar Convention by mapping wetlands, training local personnel, and making wetland mapping data publicly available. It is in the United States interest to assist countries in managing and conserving their wetlands as the drinking water and food resources they supply are shared across international borders, including our own. Wetland conservation aligns with foreign policy objectives to promote healthy and productive populations and drive sustainable economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
